- fds_mesh_query.f90: fds_get_face_bc(nm, code[6]): wall BOUNDARY_TYPE of each face of a local level-0 mesh (1 SOLID/INERT, 3 MIRROR, 0 mixed, -1 none).
- TimeLoop.cpp: pressure_bc_map() reduces it over the meshes on each domain face and the ranks into vel_bc (one type over the face, else 0 = plain mirror);
  bind_level() hands it to the fine BcStep (o.bc->vel_bc). FDS: PBZ=0 SURF 'INERT' -> 1, PBZ=1 SURF 'MIRROR' -> 3, PERIODIC -> 6 (periodic: skipped anyway).

